  "description": "The market shakeout revealed some surprising strength. One stock stood out, and is breaking out now.",
  "body_html": "<p>Despite all the negative commentary online and from media…the bull market is continuing! The only losers have been the news readers and degenerates that bought hype stocks with their buddies. The recent consolidation has only provided us with stocks with great set ups. Today’s Midweek Mover stock winner was in the tech sector. </p><p>If you are new to my page, welcome! My name is Timothy and I have been investing for 19 years, 6 of them publicly here on social media. I am a “mid-term” investor meaning I can hold a position for a few weeks or months.  I do not short term trade, or long term invest… as none of us know what will happen in the long term. I seek opportunities, <em><strong>NOW</strong></em>. </p><p>This article is a tad long, you can watch the video for the quick summary, or read below how I took a list of 25 stocks, your favorites, to find 1 that has all the right elements for a strong bullish run. </p><p>Let’s get into it! </p><div><hr></div><h4><strong>- Avoid - </strong></h4><p><strong>I know some of these stocks, look like lucrative deals, like a big discount. I like to sometimes think of stocks like a loaf of bread… if the bread is on sale, then its likely because the bread is old and getting moldy, so it is cheaper. But mold only continues spreading, and will further drop that price even further. There may be a winner amongst this bunch that is in fact bottoming… but which one? No idea. </strong></p><p><strong>Selecting stocks that are trending down, with price action below the 200 day moving average, is more often than not, a bad retail habit. You are picking stocks from the loser group. </strong></p><p><strong>If you like any of these stocks, just keep an eye on them. You do not need to get the bottom. Let the price show some strength, and structural formations, before aping in. This will increase the likelihood that you are buying into a longer term bull trend. </strong></p><p>SoFi Technologies, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SOFI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Caseys General Stores, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$CASY&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Vertiv Holdings, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$VRT&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; TTM Technologies, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$TTMI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Richtech Robotics, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RR&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Grab Holdings, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$GRAB&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>  </p><div><hr></div><h4>Ran Too Much</h4><p>If you don’t know, a large percentage of my strategy revolves around volatility contraction patterns (VCP’s) and finding initial breakouts for a specific entry point (SEPA). These most often lead us to stocks that have multi-day, or month, bull trends… giving us time to get into winning positions first, top guessing second. Getting into profit is far more important than speculating where a top will be. </p><p>When a stock has been trending up for an incredibly long period of time, we simply have no idea how much more runway it has. Another day? Another week? Another year? No idea. But the fact that one of the answers could be “another day” makes me avoid these stocks. I would not bet against them…. as that is fighting trend. But they do not present optimal entry points for us to hang on for long periods of time. </p><p>Andersen Group, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$ANDG&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Concentra Group Holdings, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$CON&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>.   </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Eg61!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Eg61!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Eg61!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Eg61!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Eg61!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Eg61!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png\" width=\"1417\" height=\"855\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:855,&quot;width&quot;:1417,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:184115,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/222478445?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Eg61!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Eg61!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Eg61!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Eg61!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4a02cf7b-acdb-4e63-9357-f6abb6acd0b1_1417x855.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><hr></div><h4>Price Action</h4><p>I see creators writing articles, that are a 500 page “deep dive” on a stock. If they did not use AI to write the article, they typically, alternatively, are trying to justify buying a stock based on future fundamentals. Maybe they will be right… but being “right” is not necessarily what is always the most profitable. </p><h4>Price action is all that matters</h4><p>Yea, I prefer a company with strong fundamentals. </p><p><em><strong>But at the end of the day, I will always choose a stock that has a stronger trend &amp; bad fundamentals over a stock with a weak trend &amp; great fundamentals. </strong></em></p><p>Here, I was seeking to eliminate the stocks with the weakest trends. The best performing stocks, normally, will have well developed long term and short term trends. Sometimes I get asked how I measure this this, and you can see the coding below:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eUsn!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eUsn!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eUsn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eUsn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eUsn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png\" width=\"363\" height=\"102\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:102,&quot;width&quot;:363,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:8760,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/222478445?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eUsn!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eUsn!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eUsn!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eUsn!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F768dc3b2-1134-4e7f-9249-a10c3b5afe42_363x102.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p>Because I am a mid-term trader, more emphasis is placed on the last 3 months of relative strength (RS) to the S&amp;P 500, a 40% weight is placed here. I still care that the stock was trending well for the past year, so it measures the stock’s performance at 3 other intervals over the last year, with a 20% rating at each point. </p><p>Is this tool perfect? No. But it eliminates dud stocks very often. We are always striving towards putting the odds in our favor. Out of the 17 remaining stocks, I eliminated over half of them, because we simply do not want weak trends:</p><p>Fastenal Company, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$FAST&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Kinder Morgan, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$KMI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; AerCap Holdings, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$AER&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Edwards Lifesciences Corporation, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$EW&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Super Micro Computer, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SMCI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>; Pandora, $pndora; Tenet Healthcare Corporation, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$THC&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. </p><p>Just because these stocks were ranked lower, does NOT mean they cannot go up. I am looking for the best stock to buy <em><strong>today. </strong></em></p><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-etf-20\">StockTok ETF 2.0</a></strong> produced numerous winning stocks, one of them being Cheesecake Factory, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$CAKE&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> which made this list.  This stock climbed nearly 30% and since been consolidating, which pulled its RS rating down. Overall, the bullish structure remains intact, with no lower lows, at least as of yet. I would consider the following:</p><ul><li><p>Trim position below $101</p></li><li><p>Cut position below $94</p></li><li><p>Add to position above $118</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XwbK!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XwbK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XwbK!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XwbK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XwbK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XwbK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png\" width=\"1431\" height=\"868\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:868,&quot;width&quot;:1431,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:249857,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/222478445?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XwbK!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XwbK!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XwbK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!XwbK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F09f403da-8168-4781-b1ad-b8fe28b66949_1431x868.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Still in a bullish consolidation… but wait for a break to one side or the other before trimming, cutting or if to the upside, adding!</figcaption></figure></div><div><hr></div><h4><strong>Bullish stocks…</strong></h4><p><strong>These 8 remaining stocks have clearly defined uptrends and survived the broad based whacking surface level analysis. Now we can dig more into the more detailed analysis, to find which one is most likely going to have a healthy bull trend ahead of it over the next few weeks or months. </strong></p><p><strong>The top stock stock had a well developed bull trend, bullish chart structure, increased earnings and revenue; characteristics that it is about to go up now…</strong></p>",
